    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: <b>VG_Articulation</b> is the component that makes a GameObject
      visible to VirtualGrasp, thus marks it as interactable. <br/> A VG_Articulation
      can be placed on any object that has a <b>MeshRenderer</b> assigned to it.<br/>
--- !u!114 &-8597187347017572839
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'Now that you have a .zip file of the geometrical data, you can 
      upload it to the Cloud Baking Server.


      The server will process the geometrical
      data and return a file that tells VirtualGrasp how to interact naturally with
      all the shapes it received.'
