    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: In this tutorial, you will go through the steps to add and <i>bake</i>
      interactable objects in your project.<br/> During this tutorial, you will be
      connected the VirtualGrasp Cloud Baking engine, so assure that you have Wifi
      connection.<br/> Lets's get started!
