    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: Now that VirtualGrasp can access the geometrical mesh data of
      objects, we extract this data in the form of .obj files that are exported into
      a local <b>vg_tmp</b> folder. <br/> For upload purpose, the content of vg_tmp
      folder will be packaged into a .zip file in your project root folder (by default
      <b>grasps.zip</b>).
